    "nootropics_101_qRn6wC": {
      "type": "nootropics-101",
      "disabled": true,
      "blocks": {
        "qa_QadKm4": {
          "type": "qa",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What Are Nootropics?",
            "answer": "<p>Nootropics are nutrients, plant extracts, and synthetics discussed in relation to focus, attention, memory, motivation, and stress. They are not a single product class. Common groups include cholinergics, amino acids, adaptogens, and <a href=\"/collections/racetams\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Racetams\">racetams</a>.</p><p>Compare the label, ingredient details, and any product-specific testing document shown on the product page. Document availability and test scope vary by product and batch. Results vary by individual and goal. No supplement replaces sleep, nutrition, hydration, and movement.</p>",
            "icon": "brain",
            "open_by_default": false,
            "cta_label": "Read the Beginner's Guide",
            "cta_url": "shopify://pages/guides-beginners-nootropics",
            "anchor": "what-are-nootropics"
          }
        },
        "qa_zyG3tE": {
          "type": "qa",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How Should I Start?",
            "answer": "<p>Begin by comparing products for one clearly defined goal, such as <a href=\"/collections/focus\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Focus\">focus</a>, <a href=\"/collections/memory\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Memory\">memory</a>, <a href=\"/collections/energy\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Energy\">energy</a>, or <a href=\"/collections/sleep\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Sleep\">sleep</a>. Review the full label, warnings, ingredient amounts, and product-specific documentation before deciding whether a product is appropriate.</p><p>Follow the product label and consult a qualified healthcare professional about conditions, medicines, pregnancy, breastfeeding, or possible interactions. The <a href=\"/pages/guides-beginners-nootropics\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Beginner's Guide\">beginner's guide</a> explains how to compare labels and evidence without prescribing a regimen.</p>",
            "icon": "rocket",
            "open_by_default": false,
            "cta_label": "Take the Stack Quiz",
            "cta_url": "shopify://pages/quiz",
            "anchor": "how-to-start"
          }
        },
        "qa_iRatqr": {
          "type": "qa",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What Is Stacking?",
            "answer": "<p>\"Stacking\" means using more than one active ingredient. Combination products can make it harder to identify which ingredient caused an effect or interaction, and evidence about individual ingredients does not automatically establish that a combination is safe or effective.</p><p>Compare every active ingredient and amount, look for duplication across labels, and discuss combinations with a qualified healthcare professional. Product listings and educational guides provide comparison context; they do not prescribe a stack, schedule, or cycle.</p>",
            "icon": "layers",
            "open_by_default": false,
            "cta_label": "Shop Pre-Built Stacks",
            "cta_url": "shopify://collections/stacks",
            "anchor": "stacking-basics"
          }
        },
        "qa_quality_coa": {
          "type": "qa",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How Do You Verify Quality?",
            "answer": "<p>Where a product-specific testing document is available, the product page identifies the document and its stated scope. Availability varies by product and batch. Review the linked document itself for the laboratory, method, lot, date, and results.</p><p>Visit the <a href=\"/pages/quality-coa-library\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Quality & COA library\">document library</a> or contact us to ask whether a document is available for a product before you buy.</p>",
            "icon": "shield",
            "open_by_default": false,
            "cta_label": "See How We Test",
            "cta_url": "/pages/quality-coa-library",
            "anchor": "quality-verification"
          }
        }
      },
