            "content": "<p>Destination eligibility depends on the item and delivery address. Checkout shows the available services for an eligible order. Import rules vary by destination; customers are responsible for confirming local import eligibility.</p><p>See our <a href=\"/pages/shipping-and-returns\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Shipping & Returns\">Shipping &amp; Returns policy</a> before ordering.</p>"
